Unknown: The fire's gone.
Unknown: No smoke. No house. Just grass, all the way out to the edge of the sky.
Unknown: [pause=0.3]Where am I?
Unknown: It's warm here. Quiet. The kind of quiet you only get when no one else is awake.
Unknown: I said yes to something. I don't know what.
Unknown: [pause=0.4]But the girl... she's close. I can feel it, the way you feel someone standing behind you.
